@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记批次库存变</u>\n<u>动控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:材料批次</u>" as Batch
participant "<u>:批次存量</u>" as Stock
participant "<u>:库存变动</u>" as Movement
participant "<u>:实际用料</u>" as Usage
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-18办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-18办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Batch : 核对可领用性(效期及停用条件)
activate Batch
Batch --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Batch
K -> Stock : 办理库存变动(类型、数量、原来源)
activate Stock
Stock -> Batch : 核对可领用性(提交时的批次当前条件)
activate Batch
Batch --> Stock : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Batch
Stock -> Movement : 保留收发经历(前后数量、经办依据)
activate Movement
Movement -> Usage : 登记实际消耗(实际使用数量、同患者就诊)
activate Usage
Usage --> Movement : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Usage
Movement --> Stock : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Movement
Stock -> Stock : 核对变动后数量(本次及并发依据)
Stock --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Stock
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Usage
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
